Description: V7 Unix PDP-11 C toolchain, modernized for a modern host
 A modern-host port of the Seventh Edition (V7) Unix PDP-11 C toolchain
 (cc, cpp/c0/c1/c2, as/as2, ld) that cross-compiles PDP-11 code.
